1
00:05:56,470 --> 00:06:02,470
In Secret is a drama, thriller, crime film directed by Charlie Stratton.

2
00:11:52,941 --> 00:11:58,941
In 1860s Paris, a young woman, Therese, is trapped in a loveless marriage to
the sickly Camille by her domineering aunt, Madame Raquin.

3
00:17:49,411 --> 00:17:55,411
She spends her days behind the counter of a small shop and her evenings
watching Madame play dominos with an eclectic group.

4
00:23:45,882 --> 00:23:51,882
After she meets her husband’s alluring friend, Laurent, she embarks on
an illicit affair that leads to tragic consequences.

5
00:29:42,352 --> 00:29:48,352
Based on Emile Zola’s novel, Thérèse Raquin.

6
00:35:38,823 --> 00:35:44,823
Thérèse Raquin, played by Elizabeth Olsen.

7
00:41:35,294 --> 00:41:41,294
Camille Raquin, played by Tom Felton.

8
00:47:31,764 --> 00:47:37,764
Madame Raquin, played by Jessica Lange.

9
00:53:28,235 --> 00:53:34,235
Olivier, played by Matt Lucas.

10
00:59:24,705 --> 00:59:30,705
Laurent LeClaire, played by Oscar Isaac.

11
01:05:21,176 --> 01:05:27,176
Suzanne, played by Shirley Henderson.

12
01:11:17,647 --> 01:11:23,647
In Secret (also known as Thérèse) is a 2013 American erotic thriller
romance film written and directed by Charlie Stratton.

13
01:17:14,117 --> 01:17:20,117
Based on Émile Zola's classic 1867 novel Thérèse Raquin and the 2009 stage play by the same name penned
by Neal Bell, the film stars Elizabeth Olsen, Tom Felton, Oscar Isaac and Jessica Lange.

14
01:23:10,588 --> 01:23:16,588
It was screened in the Special Presentation section at the
2013 Toronto International Film Festival.

15
01:29:07,058 --> 01:29:13,058
The film received a regional release on February 21, 2014.

16
01:35:03,529 --> 01:35:09,529
The tone is emotional and intense.
